# Keep the build context small and reproducible. Without this, the 60+ MB Android
# project, the Gradle caches and the imported PDF library are all uploaded to the
# Docker daemon on every build.

.git
.gitignore

# Documents live on a volume, never in the image.
data/

# The Android project is only needed to produce the APK, which is built on a
# workstation with the Android SDK, not in this image.
kiosk/android/
dist/

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite

# A stale incremental-build stamp makes `tsc -b` skip emitting into a fresh image.
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

*.log
*.apk
.env
